# InnerSpace

## What this app is
These modules are ports of those from the BackSpace days.   It was fairly
easy to get them to work under InnerSpace.app.  This app provides an "active" background for your desktop as well as a screensaver.

## What you need to do...
You need to copy these into your home directory 
at `$HOME/GNUstep/Library/InnerSpace` after you build them so that InnerSpace can
load them.

## Notice
The savers `Polyhedra.bproj`, `SporView.bproj`, and `Space2View.bproj` were available
from next-ftp.peak.org with code and source available.  I assume these are in 
the public domain.

